# EAS builds the mobile app, but archives from the git root because this is a
# monorepo. Without this, backend/.venv (238 MB) and the web build were swept
# into the upload, producing a 119 MB tarball that the API rejected with 403.
backend/
frontend/
*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.expo/
